      "message": "feat(sdk): add MemHub authority migration contracts (#129)\n\n* feat(sdk): expose memory lifecycle status filters\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* feat(sdk): persist idempotent write outcomes\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* feat(sdk): add explicit exact raw APIs\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* feat(sdk): snapshot quiesced local data plane\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* feat(sdk): restore quiesced local data plane\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix(sdk): report incomplete physical deletes\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* docs(sdk): record authority migration contracts\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: alvinfei <alvinfei@tencent.com>\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>",
