      },
      "message": "fix(coding): default-off search chain_block (diff) injection (#128)\n\nMedium/heavy coding users pay large prompt tokens for the version-evolution\ndiff block; make MEMORY_CODING_CHAIN_BLOCK_ENABLED opt-in (default false).\nWrite-side observe is unchanged; HCM_BLOCK_OFF remains an advanced kill switch.\n\nCo-authored-by: alvinfei <alvinfei@tencent.com>\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>",
