  {
    "sha": "8ea69968592686a88bb0929388acdaf71afde12a",
    "node_id": "C_kwDOVK7UKNoAKDhlYTY5OTY4NTkyNjg2YTg4YmIwOTI5Mzg4YWNkYWY3MWFmZGUxMmE",
    "commit": {
      "author": {
        "name": "feitianxiang",
        "email": "summer.achelous@gmail.com",
        "date": "2026-10-21T06:11:57Z"
      },
      "committer": {
        "name": "GitHub",
        "email": "noreply@github.com",
        "date": "2026-10-21T06:11:57Z"
      },
      "message": "chore(core): retire memory evidence freshness on read paths (#127)\n\n* chore(core): retire memory evidence freshness on read paths\n\nStop re-validating support_refs against live evidence during library,\ncontext, and call-reference reads. The check hid memories when evidence\nchanged but caused 503s and segment-key breakage; proofs may still be\nwritten but are ignored until a later teardown removes them.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* test(docs): align install-docs pin with hy-memory 2.0.4\n\nCI memhub failed because README already documents 2.0.4 / v1.0.4 while\nthe install-docs contract test still expected 2.0.3 / v1.0.3.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: alvinfei <alvinfei@tencent.com>\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>",
      "tree": {
        "sha": "8ffe093eaa57e61ae60b908d5a7503ad715bfc90",
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Tencent-Hunyuan/Hy-Memory/git/trees/8ffe093eaa57e61ae60b908d5a7503ad715bfc90"
      },
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Tencent-Hunyuan/Hy-Memory/git/commits/8ea69968592686a88bb0929388acdaf71afde12a",
      "comment_count": 0,
      "verification": {
        "verified": true,
        "reason": "valid",
        "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJq2FetCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAacAQADP0VQ7dKs9PrceOGo+ugoc7\nlcs0C5SXxaWvWWyfHykzxDt9UVfNRx901SuRlI25djoVypU7BupMdOIQOPD1UJlH\nU3zbg+hK0QzeUHNWBrjITMU0mlScN9hOUV8eL5A4K0cFkoCGxCwPj6tI0htHn2CK\nYVI8hcYoi80VU6d4x+8ZN5ZToONFOXrXi6KN5MHEcHjYiCyz4pCAEDIAtVXfuGNR\nvFPepVJbGu6ZvJNBqAH0HSXvP/mE2sgJsyJYJMLNEAqPUzYnCEBX6RWXbYO1z5nH\nHNTMcjHY2ci/exj2bFaU+MP6QktPnTAs+qgsIBwx2FTOKwY0zZauKV137pxjOXy8\nJoFpYSYw+7T6R36s8sD3lLy2VQ3b5H71deuIylB07fiNe1VkgcGNag3kJdyVyCv5\nQJgvWap3/Cv/s+VnaUT9X6Ah3/JETHwOkj77CSqSRSCGCHz5nQYytbx+M6M/OuFs\nPkXID5uexSrP9g08gMUZUaV2/o5Ea8rdJShTG77rsKhViu5RgXjKcdOp0fbosZpU\nEuO2+OzAHDqYczBhAKorpnYt7z7HDMFSNnajN15tAoSgc/LHqAaDzBDUkx8pLP/K\nMrObjGsW01t88aYrLDUm8QPE9+NiCutPs0BKv+3xXofPlZWG8zzYQjhOlSvg1m+k\noNIqZu0Uqdq0higLbduI\n=c/Q9\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n",
        "payload": "tree 8ffe093eaa57e61ae60b908d5a7503ad715bfc90\nparent dc740604d295bf8a69aeb374259321f82994d803\nauthor feitianxiang <summer.achelous@gmail.com> 1792563117 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1792563117 +0800\n\nchore(core): retire memory evidence freshness on read paths (#127)\n\n* chore(core): retire memory evidence freshness on read paths\n\nStop re-validating support_refs against live evidence during library,\ncontext, and call-reference reads. The check hid memories when evidence\nchanged but caused 503s and segment-key breakage; proofs may still be\nwritten but are ignored until a later teardown removes them.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* test(docs): align install-docs pin with hy-memory 2.0.4\n\nCI memhub failed because README already documents 2.0.4 / v1.0.4 while\nthe install-docs contract test still expected 2.0.3 / v1.0.3.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: alvinfei <alvinfei@tencent.com>\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>",
