  {
    "sha": "14fcc6fe3805060fb9607348d1125dcb6b43a0c4",
    "node_id": "C_kwDOVK7UKNoAKDE0ZmNjNmZlMzgwNTA2MGZiOTYwNzM0OGQxMTI1ZGNiNmI0M2EwYzQ",
    "commit": {
      "author": {
        "name": "u7-u7",
        "email": "116776533+u7-u7@users.noreply.github.com",
        "date": "2026-10-21T04:19:47Z"
      },
      "committer": {
        "name": "GitHub",
        "email": "noreply@github.com",
        "date": "2026-10-21T04:19:47Z"
      },
      "message": "fix(history): query every agent when agent_ids is omitted (#93)\n\nget_recent_history() documented \"agent_ids 为空时查询该用户所有 agent\" but\nconstructed the isolation key with the literal \"default\". History records\nare written as \"{user_id}:{agent_id}\", and add() defaults to\n\"default_agent\", so the documented path usually returned nothing.\n\nAdd HistoryStore.get_recent_for_user(), which matches the literal user\nprefix with an escaped LIKE, and use it from the client. Add regressions\nfor multiple agents, a sibling user id and LIKE wildcards in the user id.\n\nCo-authored-by: qiye.sjh <shijiahao_0802@youzan.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>",
      "tree": {
        "sha": "59e4173ceb5f43d8bd3296f852fceb7f7d18ff03",
