        "verified": true,
        "reason": "valid",
        "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJq2D1jCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAcYEQAD28kYShKOjxm2rJvdR1cHUy\neIQ9zBdIoqbXOIuAIxsU8ARuDJniccaPLNlAVu1OlGMcCe95/VFJ0cpRf3jEyQWF\nr8A1ltdfj2o98lCKxcHNGizX6QG698x9B4gBKDF1Dz5O/8wnR7HZIxHpRsETp6+G\n9T2QRl5k/HwRrmOcni0porAmXvZKwcMY9XnzIV0YhH9eMas4j/b/eVmC72vTCuX9\nkitOR93c0Wosif9S6KEJXf1HlfQPENRygdvXcc0Eel/VmqKFsQUIClC3P5RaTydG\nRkk5pIl80Zv1uelsO/ov1iACrOhkfnVJ5lUcBLCKacSqXM0q17rMYEUEuMuUdwJ6\nSI4MTDy5VYSW5UyFKxeiabxtwee97JJtSeN5rxxOON2oqCpvjIIyyM/O62qJOVdP\nBt71aAIhMEe0n710sERWL1yxFAgB6L0PAbFIOyLp16e/1UYNZlAckhy/XqrSWizM\nkvu3vnFYz/5wvT1jLRebexK4jQO5fZcRC2Ydf/Uai4l2rYZcPi+ZkQSXAeLqIJzH\nASnfd+679Hq1Xl8UTzJun6pfNHAD89Qmbd5nF99KXCTNXqIG3aekbSsbyRLUSNEU\nfj2dmxMDUCToxdJfgj0FXsyTvjt8Nxlttq2vV5clIAFYvz/Qp1gCQzTsjCBAYFbJ\nHdHmJ+qGsvVFc+HmpLLk\n=IohR\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n",
        "payload": "tree 59e4173ceb5f43d8bd3296f852fceb7f7d18ff03\nparent 1ef0766891393c93b967142c0c8aaeb91e6e200c\nauthor u7-u7 <116776533+u7-u7@users.noreply.github.com> 1792556387 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1792556387 +0800\n\nfix(history): query every agent when agent_ids is omitted (#93)\n\nget_recent_history() documented \"agent_ids 为空时查询该用户所有 agent\" but\nconstructed the isolation key with the literal \"default\". History records\nare written as \"{user_id}:{agent_id}\", and add() defaults to\n\"default_agent\", so the documented path usually returned nothing.\n\nAdd HistoryStore.get_recent_for_user(), which matches the literal user\nprefix with an escaped LIKE, and use it from the client. Add regressions\nfor multiple agents, a sibling user id and LIKE wildcards in the user id.\n\nCo-authored-by: qiye.sjh <shijiahao_0802@youzan.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>",
        "verified_at": "2026-10-21T04:19:47Z"
      }
