  {
    "sha": "1ef0766891393c93b967142c0c8aaeb91e6e200c",
    "node_id": "C_kwDOVK7UKNoAKDFlZjA3NjY4OTEzOTNjOTNiOTY3MTQyYzBjOGFhZWI5MWU2ZTIwMGM",
    "commit": {
      "author": {
        "name": "u7-u7",
        "email": "116776533+u7-u7@users.noreply.github.com",
        "date": "2026-10-21T04:19:42Z"
      },
      "committer": {
        "name": "GitHub",
        "email": "noreply@github.com",
        "date": "2026-10-21T04:19:42Z"
      },
      "message": "fix(agent): restore the SessionSummaryResult dataclass decorator (#92)\n\nThe @dataclass decorator was left at the end of the section-divider comment\nline, so SessionSummaryResult was a plain class without __init__. Every\nconstruction raised \"takes no arguments\" - including the error branch inside\ngenerate_session_summary(), whose TypeError escaped the surrounding except.\n\nMove the decorator onto its own line and add a constructor regression.\n\nCo-authored-by: qiye.sjh <shijiahao_0802@youzan.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>",
      "tree": {
        "sha": "80eb4f0375209e3f171ff3c3ec42a39d1f2571f9",
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Tencent-Hunyuan/Hy-Memory/git/trees/80eb4f0375209e3f171ff3c3ec42a39d1f2571f9"
      },
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Tencent-Hunyuan/Hy-Memory/git/commits/1ef0766891393c93b967142c0c8aaeb91e6e200c",
      "comment_count": 0,
      "verification": {
        "verified": true,
        "reason": "valid",
        "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJq2D1fCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAY94QAJagz9kMsBVKJJP887ontULT\nUe65ke5bC2lmH9FpQ1S0A+KN2I1SCuGjglguPf0sERAiokavl/7GywYeB+ajtI82\njubYFWYBNt+FFxRum5oJnoLcI9IucBKVZK/o2zzHuOHLyvZa3mvrUeniGC+D/YPe\ndxaBsWSQEH79eu/53a0cGpop8qOwsbLhqDELiFUyPka/2Jdb3cFButRiQEt6zlTF\npaf09peDO92DT945GN3JL8tLIo+BEXXtHb8N2I93p+Eq/4Iv35vAqOBJQXCPyaso\nTXcyriwY7znQvLxNNkfB6GT4lVx/xzCeVfuxYEeMDlh6d0ymCUKN59NKqFoiZDvL\nGQjLM4mNJZLhNkcsG6kbD3y0JLoqDSJTfgke13xahZbFTr7vQxbKZ1gALYsfGNOv\nst2OWjAKvJStmuEdJE7SG+YleoaM9P0tASY7dc3mGiOpO5hs2aklQJd2MDxM0RzW\nxY+bZpC9xovZxyiAAobQ7PSiDcwnoaezRmMYcu874MOwzXoGaQ0Q3Y0m/wouBoz8\n+yV8rHD7sKxkyTzJjQBob5Ydk9OvKA2S2SYlB8vce0jmwbPGDJTZXz8/hA2Lcpqq\nna3I9yvkJOgCm9mFlWn14HlbAiPCz+CMWFS+iu0CO6D6yXwVdXHYCfNk91KNcYDM\n107SvrjwAU9GvOehpS6r\n=Ycqi\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n",
        "payload": "tree 80eb4f0375209e3f171ff3c3ec42a39d1f2571f9\nparent 3370a715dd5c76d70bd52b34a21185bbf4e5d21c\nauthor u7-u7 <116776533+u7-u7@users.noreply.github.com> 1792556382 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1792556382 +0800\n\nfix(agent): restore the SessionSummaryResult dataclass decorator (#92)\n\nThe @dataclass decorator was left at the end of the section-divider comment\nline, so SessionSummaryResult was a plain class without __init__. Every\nconstruction raised \"takes no arguments\" - including the error branch inside\ngenerate_session_summary(), whose TypeError escaped the surrounding except.\n\nMove the decorator onto its own line and add a constructor regression.\n\nCo-authored-by: qiye.sjh <shijiahao_0802@youzan.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>",
        "verified_at": "2026-10-21T04:19:43Z"
      }
