        "date": "2026-10-21T04:19:33Z"
      },
      "message": "fix(server): avoid deadlock when shutting down on signals (#89)\n\nBaseServer.shutdown() waits for serve_forever() to return. The SIGINT /\nSIGTERM handlers called it directly, and signal handlers run on the same\nthread that is executing serve_forever(), so the server could never exit:\nthe process hung until SIGKILL and the client was never closed.\n\nAsk a helper thread to call shutdown() and move server_close()/client.close()\ninto a finally block after serve_forever() returns. Add an in-process test\nand a subprocess test that fires SIGALRM while serving on the main thread.\n\nCo-authored-by: qiye.sjh <shijiahao_0802@youzan.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>",
      "tree": {
        "sha": "a15b48f11b31157194ab57b19f8ffe33aa27ee1c",
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Tencent-Hunyuan/Hy-Memory/git/trees/a15b48f11b31157194ab57b19f8ffe33aa27ee1c"
      },
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Tencent-Hunyuan/Hy-Memory/git/commits/638d1b7bde428ae8641f229eae374bbe9e9aa5a9",
      "comment_count": 0,
      "verification": {
        "verified": true,
        "reason": "valid",
        "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJq2D1VCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAHWUQAH5To3JH3i0EHA3WwqE0+MoS\nfd95xRoMEYLoSmuF7GmfM9+Ih3dPvBacgnBtz8H/6NMkUof58m9PKQG5h17IaAEC\nYYbakbHQG6nix+fJQNt+jqzqDrztQQc3Ywr7Vnus8LKkUVHTZDdfMjivQPv2WGYF\nHoE+6QsBUbXGZ1qoDDwMgpGcvjSQdJeaQ1vJHgHu5wRYprHNbxcgqI7D2ZDGvy6M\nfvfeKTB2v3lTIwUSnO1o0cM9ewZ8yo56k3/qeHxgQW+r0yjNrIkEGzhWkpupZm9N\nCSBicjOtLLKlCwBT5zm1/mi8bhj7KgUMOcX+7xPIBTE8VyWPs1lNC842Ea5A45Yb\nw+pI+2QC8f24D1LRhZSlfoYOpzuYfhezVcaFH2CowbKOPb+BStcnw2aNDtP9gBDn\nwzsJKVp5Sl1udZtw91RX8JlZsLhV4GCHADu2sBQtRnRhio67XrO8RrIuIcBW/Z/E\ng6inD845d8rohhtvnOQ+TITh3efPGHcqfun7HLtCWrDb3g0PQr4IBzFJZ6i+i9KX\nqVBKV5U4349thRHGWAuhmR+QWS2Efmzy7z3Sepj3KpypoaY7SNNb47FecwqVb70A\nkOTeGs1VxhOT27M3yCf7wBGxCqUkmnkG+MX7tqUx4utq/989OZ3FOdP+o1HkoICL\nsqzQihaQlgDmgyslqmuL\n=lvYi\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n",
        "payload": "tree a15b48f11b31157194ab57b19f8ffe33aa27ee1c\nparent d6890793ec336367a5825d47279868b8c19aea67\nauthor u7-u7 <116776533+u7-u7@users.noreply.github.com> 1792556373 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1792556373 +0800\n\nfix(server): avoid deadlock when shutting down on signals (#89)\n\nBaseServer.shutdown() waits for serve_forever() to return. The SIGINT /\nSIGTERM handlers called it directly, and signal handlers run on the same\nthread that is executing serve_forever(), so the server could never exit:\nthe process hung until SIGKILL and the client was never closed.\n\nAsk a helper thread to call shutdown() and move server_close()/client.close()\ninto a finally block after serve_forever() returns. Add an in-process test\nand a subprocess test that fires SIGALRM while serving on the main thread.\n\nCo-authored-by: qiye.sjh <shijiahao_0802@youzan.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>",
        "verified_at": "2026-10-21T04:19:34Z"
      }
