        "payload": "tree 0584b43838ba1d8f03577ac5ac16127ddbd01124\nparent b6e6a3fb43fc39738d64800c70c0faea488405ff\nauthor u7-u7 <116776533+u7-u7@users.noreply.github.com> 1792556363 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1792556363 +0800\n\ndocs: point install instructions at the current releases (#113)\n\nThe install blocks still asked for hy-memory 2.0.3 (and 2.0.1 extras),\nMemHub 1.0.3 (build 7), and said memhub-cli was unpublished. pyproject.toml\nships 2.0.4, the MemHub workspace ships 1.0.4 (build 13), and README already\nannounces memhub-cli 1.0.5.\n\nUpdate the install commands and the release metadata in the root READMEs,\nthe usage/search guides, the monorepo policy, and the MemHub docs. Historical\nCHANGELOG entries are deliberately unchanged.\n\nCo-authored-by: qiye.sjh <shijiahao_0802@youzan.com>",
