      "committer": {
        "name": "GitHub",
        "email": "noreply@github.com",
        "date": "2026-10-21T04:19:18Z"
      },
      "message": "test(core): skip fixtures that are absent from the public snapshot (#112)\n\nFour test modules import artifacts that are not in this repository:\none_memory.processing_requests and three scripts/bench_*.py files. A public\ncheckout therefore fails during collection, so the whole core-fast suite\ncannot start even though every collected test is fine.\n\nSkip only when the module or script is missing. Builds that carry the private\nartifacts keep running the same tests unchanged.\n\nCo-authored-by: qiye.sjh <shijiahao_0802@youzan.com>",
      "tree": {
        "sha": "88d32b8449ac52c3cd36bcbe9c17e723cfc7b194",
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Tencent-Hunyuan/Hy-Memory/git/trees/88d32b8449ac52c3cd36bcbe9c17e723cfc7b194"
      },
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Tencent-Hunyuan/Hy-Memory/git/commits/b6e6a3fb43fc39738d64800c70c0faea488405ff",
