        "payload": "tree 88d32b8449ac52c3cd36bcbe9c17e723cfc7b194\nparent 4e44f59026726ad89f8bbda347d7604ad0971aa6\nauthor u7-u7 <116776533+u7-u7@users.noreply.github.com> 1792556358 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1792556358 +0800\n\ntest(core): skip fixtures that are absent from the public snapshot (#112)\n\nFour test modules import artifacts that are not in this repository:\none_memory.processing_requests and three scripts/bench_*.py files. A public\ncheckout therefore fails during collection, so the whole core-fast suite\ncannot start even though every collected test is fine.\n\nSkip only when the module or script is missing. Builds that carry the private\nartifacts keep running the same tests unchanged.\n\nCo-authored-by: qiye.sjh <shijiahao_0802@youzan.com>",
