  {
    "sha": "2cea39da4f9f536e81122bda0ec299e0fd5bc0e7",
    "node_id": "C_kwDOVK7UKNoAKDJjZWEzOWRhNGY5ZjUzNmU4MTEyMmJkYTBlYzI5OWUwZmQ1YmMwZTc",
    "commit": {
      "author": {
        "name": "feitianxiang",
        "email": "summer.achelous@gmail.com",
        "date": "2026-10-21T04:15:26Z"
      },
      "committer": {
        "name": "GitHub",
        "email": "noreply@github.com",
        "date": "2026-10-21T04:15:26Z"
      },
      "message": "fix(core): drop native store write gate on HY search (#126)\n\nMemHub expects concurrent native reads during precipitation. The\nprocess-local read slot mostly existed for a Chroma/GIL fail-fast and\nwas never held by writers on main; activating it (as in #98) would only\npush recall onto weaker fallbacks. Remove the lock module and the\nhy_memory_store_busy path instead.\n\nCo-authored-by: alvinfei <alvinfei@tencent.com>\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>",
      "tree": {
        "sha": "11113c85a2d1d4ebc8902ccddf2962fb0af40c1b",
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Tencent-Hunyuan/Hy-Memory/git/trees/11113c85a2d1d4ebc8902ccddf2962fb0af40c1b"
      },
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Tencent-Hunyuan/Hy-Memory/git/commits/2cea39da4f9f536e81122bda0ec299e0fd5bc0e7",
      "comment_count": 0,
      "verification": {
        "verified": true,
        "reason": "valid",
        "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJq2DxeCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAcSgQAIB029Nf48g/dEH+MMDaZEPL\nEgx87qwH9YC7+M/MNQXM0Zd6OzI+onVj882Pw4763Po0qbmUhV3TZ7Twrw8/f5BC\nkp+BaAh2Dv0HeSPaIJJkiX682xk0chp8C1yfAVrvsDvfn8mR9Hoh6bbXZsGkbG62\nnIklI2lD85NjtN4nuXznURxZnU8iiuVyKPBG5b4H48A1JCdTTTkokTMss6q7C5mp\nZyuLXpw0gVHer+pF5dhwf3FYVWGuQAnqzUySmAF/KFaf/IBLCTNbgehPFAa3Cyih\n9XRV7HonIei+3Juf4hv8TWi1V70A5SN6S91oAq8/JIbBzSb7m/nsqZKfjspkSooL\nXUECJelALlfeh4Lg0h+qFds1t/bAW1PPms9uzW+ecHifHhtiHwPmZiCAAbmcpBjg\n0eVPxYq/nrhLtC24lKARV25aL5rqEWdyhC5yYy9RFiVhjzNaZ9qRP5y+ke+p0oQs\nx4v00h+27utU8JmHhVW81hxBB4GPkhaKvy3+9Tr8c0k2WzWvMxTz1I5h1luCBf6h\n2Af7VfAO5GnAr1d0WEkGr8pM/KDXAI6TFZzxhWAfxiaD5goychT4MVmWw9xb7QKj\nT4ycvIvitSo7j/Yq+qgj6SbeSWv3BL+v8L2/uTfhB4Osj3yfMaZU0vbucGwhCP4V\n9ggM5S06HfWK1gI/fkVC\n=OtRG\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n",
        "payload": "tree 11113c85a2d1d4ebc8902ccddf2962fb0af40c1b\nparent 059e3a49037d45d03cfaddb6a8e78b5d8d5179ff\nauthor feitianxiang <summer.achelous@gmail.com> 1792556126 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1792556126 +0800\n\nfix(core): drop native store write gate on HY search (#126)\n\nMemHub expects concurrent native reads during precipitation. The\nprocess-local read slot mostly existed for a Chroma/GIL fail-fast and\nwas never held by writers on main; activating it (as in #98) would only\npush recall onto weaker fallbacks. Remove the lock module and the\nhy_memory_store_busy path instead.\n\nCo-authored-by: alvinfei <alvinfei@tencent.com>\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>",
        "verified_at": "2026-10-21T04:15:27Z"
