  {
    "sha": "514bf5c47bc22cc211a16990ec2908e6f62d6a21",
    "node_id": "C_kwDOVK7UKNoAKDUxNGJmNWM0N2JjMjJjYzIxMWExNjk5MGVjMjkwOGU2ZjYyZDZhMjE",
    "commit": {
      "author": {
        "name": "u7-u7",
        "email": "116776533+u7-u7@users.noreply.github.com",
        "date": "2026-10-21T03:02:58Z"
      },
      "committer": {
        "name": "GitHub",
        "email": "noreply@github.com",
        "date": "2026-10-21T03:02:58Z"
      },
      "message": "fix(intention): preserve isolation scope in L7 recall and dedup (#81)\n\nSession-scoped searches build only isolation_keys and leave user_ids /\nagent_ids unset. recall_intentions had no isolation_keys parameter, so the\nVDB query ran without any tenancy filter and could return every user's\nintentions.\n\nThe duplicate bucket also ignored user_id / agent_id. Two users with a\nsimilar intention on the same day were treated as duplicates, and the\nloser was hard-deleted through vector_store.delete().\n\nPass isolation_key / isolation_keys through to the vector search and add\nuser_id / agent_id to the dedup bucket key. Add regression tests for the\nparameter forwarding, cross-user recall, and cross-user dedup.\n\nCo-authored-by: qiye.sjh <shijiahao_0802@youzan.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>",
      "tree": {
        "sha": "6f7db2a0e5b9efe03eaa4185334b9bbb7b701c28",
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Tencent-Hunyuan/Hy-Memory/git/trees/6f7db2a0e5b9efe03eaa4185334b9bbb7b701c28"
      },
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Tencent-Hunyuan/Hy-Memory/git/commits/514bf5c47bc22cc211a16990ec2908e6f62d6a21",
      "comment_count": 0,
      "verification": {
        "verified": true,
        "reason": "valid",
        "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJq2CtiCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAofIQADLk02mFmm+PFqZyTz8CpQk1\nYG0SQXq4M1SRJy3pwZV4S/+hvH//IvVUxwI2vF1VRpsEo49+ffAzg0UKB56/LSdc\nudrjuZSzFESRL/eEDdaNckym1PwKwjtNZ5Y2pBbz8TQx3b58IYxUGT7MOVkK9AfO\nju2WigBx1A32e1UP9HvnPsXAPEU+JAhxO8HZvkb1gNj0iWQ4NVBzVv+RnAQq2G2+\nLDrRKflm4t4cvXj/3Pqk/rjU/uFL/yt1vZM4XIJJGcykoVQ+Yeb/IVuayLl31DXp\nDZqW/+FYGziaGzndZ93ofmnLjT41/T9oC64nzpyQpmiRxoWInWYtKIreU7jBF6O6\nzayQhpb5M3pzL+unzBs/W/tOm5KQVK1CRgYumXLBfvDjF5kyaXf1Af5y04+qbP5O\nGb+8T5z8MUYnxzg4ETS1R9XSqiuqwPfMx/vx4vlA4zdF5eUIcKBYkk/XwVRysl0g\nVKSvd8L9Fb9dz+BedDZcXMDcX0WpCUganeTsqVMoPxkn1YlJvWaLSjzm9wNl5JCH\naJ1o2v+YNx2IVc/ihfgUiCM33Vl4428q6WXgL/M8zpiCCjJV5XRqvtObV8z+U3Oc\nmqEMPHcjbD19zALV5Bt6IbEcEvnWCb7rElkEhCrSD3vo+Q3k8M7jUL2rLVl2S+DE\nqPdWYzqMC+HsKTnfKytU\n=AGy6\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n",
        "payload": "tree 6f7db2a0e5b9efe03eaa4185334b9bbb7b701c28\nparent 4bc918af7a0a65e7cd12ed410eb60ac6eee63c5c\nauthor u7-u7 <116776533+u7-u7@users.noreply.github.com> 1792551778 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1792551778 +0800\n\nfix(intention): preserve isolation scope in L7 recall and dedup (#81)\n\nSession-scoped searches build only isolation_keys and leave user_ids /\nagent_ids unset. recall_intentions had no isolation_keys parameter, so the\nVDB query ran without any tenancy filter and could return every user's\nintentions.\n\nThe duplicate bucket also ignored user_id / agent_id. Two users with a\nsimilar intention on the same day were treated as duplicates, and the\nloser was hard-deleted through vector_store.delete().\n\nPass isolation_key / isolation_keys through to the vector search and add\nuser_id / agent_id to the dedup bucket key. Add regression tests for the\nparameter forwarding, cross-user recall, and cross-user dedup.\n\nCo-authored-by: qiye.sjh <shijiahao_0802@youzan.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>",
        "verified_at": "2026-10-21T03:02:59Z"
      }
    },
