  {
    "sha": "75163a0d1ef3208fea932505d8d5e37296f16130",
    "node_id": "C_kwDOVK7UKNoAKDc1MTYzYTBkMWVmMzIwOGZlYTkzMjUwNWQ4ZDVlMzcyOTZmMTYxMzA",
    "commit": {
      "author": {
        "name": "u7-u7",
        "email": "116776533+u7-u7@users.noreply.github.com",
        "date": "2026-10-21T03:02:44Z"
      },
      "committer": {
        "name": "GitHub",
        "email": "noreply@github.com",
        "date": "2026-10-21T03:02:44Z"
      },
      "message": "fix(import): truncate oversized verbatim instead of wedging the job (#95)\n\nA single record above MAX_VERBATIM_CHARACTERS failed EvidenceInput\nvalidation. The import retried it three times, failed the whole job at the\nread phase, and the byte checkpoint resumed onto the same record, so every\nlater record in the source stayed unimported.\n\nClamp verbatim and raw_verbatim in to_evidence(), keeping the head and an\nexplicit \"...[truncated: original N chars]\" marker. The identity hash still\nuses the clamped raw_verbatim, and records that were previously rejected\nnever had a stored identity to collide with.\n\nAdd regressions for the oversized and normal paths, and update the Core test\ninventory.\n\nRefs #68\n\nCo-authored-by: qiye.sjh <shijiahao_0802@youzan.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>",
      "tree": {
        "sha": "80eabb371959887fdc9b80a8d613c52b2dec0cfa",
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Tencent-Hunyuan/Hy-Memory/git/trees/80eabb371959887fdc9b80a8d613c52b2dec0cfa"
      },
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Tencent-Hunyuan/Hy-Memory/git/commits/75163a0d1ef3208fea932505d8d5e37296f16130",
      "comment_count": 0,
      "verification": {
        "verified": true,
        "reason": "valid",
        "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJq2CtUCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAidYQADgI+bJDsVY+ItVvameZe+j7\nMGVogrRprviFmhA4YOASttmCP+zOyhamdx+NNffiIKfsO0geYLKqjdaExXoTvYt0\nMLn4Kcf+zsxu2SZ+3VBXF5xFRVRoZiCiXCbZ/SuLAHDQB/GTLnelWeOR/qiTm/KO\ne2rho0wB1x9hhuDUN2RPUeQyrFkblsVHrSJJKF18WWkkJeHI8wKNmmx6NYFjXeuX\nJjvgYYHVjq5Gim+zQjpsdxbWS+FGh8bu3si2LG0EhAEK9sSjIIXmZJheb/zXbU7c\nYT2R7zbAsDjp/fqE7QurL+FciUUeUA6GFYW/Y3mSVtz+8V/uzMJ9a8NMglf1wCq1\nbR6mV/4pnXlVBWbMHwh5/P4jp4j3fSneBL2mfq0DCYl3LcTTDwdVY7MNDw27LgLO\nwQKy5G0OMtUVPDBgoqWa059XCGHWj9+YqNK+ln52aDcEyXTTH3sN/w+JmXTBcji5\ndZLzcBk8L10nMfxwfE6SIfHLc/z4NmgH0SbkAgkWkh5I9pH3E+Xe4j397W8Mrk27\nvr9sDSRaayv9qn250IJT+JG6FnuwExxfk1hL/wv6Dc6bGkKem+1xfj3eYgZOBF/Z\nPOuELIz2tChiijgLlfaw83pB9G8HABsmJkYnMN2/XeGeqbsIGGRoSMGRnyrxn6xG\n8BikbjKzefKKJ30WtNPi\n=4pB2\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n",
        "payload": "tree 80eabb371959887fdc9b80a8d613c52b2dec0cfa\nparent 09e4bc8a307ec9c52bc03a292a44d8b691e9a4c0\nauthor u7-u7 <116776533+u7-u7@users.noreply.github.com> 1792551764 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1792551764 +0800\n\nfix(import): truncate oversized verbatim instead of wedging the job (#95)\n\nA single record above MAX_VERBATIM_CHARACTERS failed EvidenceInput\nvalidation. The import retried it three times, failed the whole job at the\nread phase, and the byte checkpoint resumed onto the same record, so every\nlater record in the source stayed unimported.\n\nClamp verbatim and raw_verbatim in to_evidence(), keeping the head and an\nexplicit \"...[truncated: original N chars]\" marker. The identity hash still\nuses the clamped raw_verbatim, and records that were previously rejected\nnever had a stored identity to collide with.\n\nAdd regressions for the oversized and normal paths, and update the Core test\ninventory.\n\nRefs #68\n\nCo-authored-by: qiye.sjh <shijiahao_0802@youzan.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>",
        "verified_at": "2026-10-21T03:02:45Z"
      }
