  },
  {
    "sha": "09e4bc8a307ec9c52bc03a292a44d8b691e9a4c0",
    "node_id": "C_kwDOVK7UKNoAKDA5ZTRiYzhhMzA3ZWM5YzUyYmMwM2EyOTJhNDRkOGI2OTFlOWE0YzA",
    "commit": {
      "author": {
        "name": "u7-u7",
        "email": "116776533+u7-u7@users.noreply.github.com",
        "date": "2026-10-21T03:02:36Z"
      },
      "committer": {
        "name": "GitHub",
        "email": "noreply@github.com",
        "date": "2026-10-21T03:02:36Z"
      },
      "message": "fix(logging): keep user_id namespaces inside the pipeline log root (#83)\n\nPipelineLogWriter derives its subdirectory from the caller-controlled\nuser_id prefix before \"__\". That prefix was joined directly to the log\nroot, so an absolute prefix or \"..\" escaped it: user_id=\"/tmp/evil__u1\"\ncreated /tmp/evil and appended the daily log there.\n\nWhitelist a single safe path component and, as defence in depth, verify\nthe resolved directory stays under the configured root. Sanitize\ndefault_subdir the same way. Add regressions for absolute, parent and\nnested prefixes plus a malicious default subdir.\n\nCo-authored-by: qiye.sjh <shijiahao_0802@youzan.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>",
      "tree": {
        "sha": "5941d59b4f5af654f7edbf4430416d1694b6c183",
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Tencent-Hunyuan/Hy-Memory/git/trees/5941d59b4f5af654f7edbf4430416d1694b6c183"
      },
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Tencent-Hunyuan/Hy-Memory/git/commits/09e4bc8a307ec9c52bc03a292a44d8b691e9a4c0",
      "comment_count": 0,
      "verification": {
        "verified": true,
        "reason": "valid",
        "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJq2CtMCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAoU8QAJsohDGIKSv9bzs52EEe4JJa\nAHKKqOVE3veH77xUhmJG/B6P/UyoBjNo2U3H42zWc78knkIhqYjRbG1QgeEfFCUe\nQXUJXXqb9t7NSgCLzA9LrgUfAAqHs9QWd5IJdaxiv8+IWdYQM8CvViJKDMxr8JHn\n0Hw2hP5SCJQeVjCobd1ujbXJBngo4N+O9bW5fhiu7/k06saISOcGGEo/jz3ZWBOq\nTJs0ulDmzNfP6xHUYm68ROoRlQFpi51gD1qwmDh6PmFRNkpNLuq04huwMOfHoWK8\nayq65U7/J8+g5uoBLFDpKIb4JETiAy2tcgX9LBIf0+log501aHKjxeXtB1CNjI06\nQRBZ3EZGXxb6HWxub21scOKXkBbr7CIzeO9tJEBrZt7kELhjGy6fQKpFURND/cwf\nEnxNTl9CoDvxNw8uwEC4xdjJaY4cxx3vB2VzuVMK2mQNpfzJCzjAdI0QYZOv0Gis\n0aL2YssPOK/5i+D3HG9ViwJwwbHNJ+x3+3cjOVHe70CqcUaVDHKLO9D5mdlijp5W\nRINwFWhywclC9xzdMQOzMtHIQlSGDIXDw70hV5Uu2dweVFMG1lLHgfF61+RqRa6K\nCMDqXIxRqUe6SbhOiLpkhBja7LHgmPLhR2FTB2HtFnPHOE6tYMkHmKAjiriYWQdT\nhqbohaOLOX6LIzUFw2oj\n=MFEm\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n",
        "payload": "tree 5941d59b4f5af654f7edbf4430416d1694b6c183\nparent 4dbf7b6ed2cbdb28056b3468930d2147f17e0f10\nauthor u7-u7 <116776533+u7-u7@users.noreply.github.com> 1792551756 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1792551756 +0800\n\nfix(logging): keep user_id namespaces inside the pipeline log root (#83)\n\nPipelineLogWriter derives its subdirectory from the caller-controlled\nuser_id prefix before \"__\". That prefix was joined directly to the log\nroot, so an absolute prefix or \"..\" escaped it: user_id=\"/tmp/evil__u1\"\ncreated /tmp/evil and appended the daily log there.\n\nWhitelist a single safe path component and, as defence in depth, verify\nthe resolved directory stays under the configured root. Sanitize\ndefault_subdir the same way. Add regressions for absolute, parent and\nnested prefixes plus a malicious default subdir.\n\nCo-authored-by: qiye.sjh <shijiahao_0802@youzan.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>",
        "verified_at": "2026-10-21T03:02:36Z"
      }
    },
